Fixtures for the Jira provider. acli is not run in the sandbox that wrote them (running a downloaded
binary is refused there), so every file is hand-written from the Jira REST issue shape and the documented
`acli jira workitem view --json` option set. Refresh against a real site by hand: see
docs/DEV_ENVIRONMENT.md "acli fixtures".

issue-string-dev.json   hand-written; Development field in its string form, 3 pull requests, GitHub
issue-object-dev.json   hand-written; Development field as an object holding cachedValue.summary
issue-no-dev.json       hand-written; no Development field
issue-short-dev.json    hand-written; string form whose json part is missing
